<title>DENMARK: Denmark's EAC H1 result up to 176 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Denmark's EAC H1 result up to 176 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping and trading company East Asiatic Company (EAC) on Tuesday reported first half 1996 ordinary pre-tax profit of 176 million crowns, up from 164 million in the same period last year.</p>
<p>The report forecast a 1996 full-year result better than 1995's 216 million crowns.</p>
